	"reason": "By using Search Velocity as a reward, the solver prioritizes restart strategies that maximize tree pruning (backjump depth) relative to search depth, while the dynamic exploration factor $C$ prevents the solver from getting stuck in suboptimal phases when the problem structure shifts.",

